Changes: the libm helper macros are replaced by local inline functions (gf_asuint, gf_asfloat, ...), the FORCE_EVAL
calls (they only raise the inexact flag) are dropped, __math_oflowf(0) and __math_uflowf(0) are written as their
results (+infinity and +0), double_t and float_t are fixed to double and float, and the functions are renamed with a
gf_ prefix and made static. Polynomial coefficients, tables, thresholds and evaluation order are unchanged.

